{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18826","headline":"詶留守牛相公宫城早秋寓言见寄 · 刘禹锡","name":"詶留守牛相公宫城早秋寓言见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晓月映宫树，秋光起天津。\n凉风稍动叶，宿露未生尘。\n星气尚芳丽，旷望感心神。\n挥毫成逸韵，开合迟来宾。\n摆去将相印，渐爲逍遥身。\n如招後房宴，却要白头人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18826.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18826","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}